WEBVTT

00:10:30.163 --> 00:10:33.297
When we abandon our grand plans
and great ambitions

00:10:33.330 --> 00:10:36.230
in favor of taking that first step,

00:10:36.263 --> 00:10:37.763
we shift.

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:40.097
And paradoxically,

00:10:40.097 --> 00:10:43.330
it's only in that tiny shift

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:47.230
that our grand plans and great ambitions

00:10:47.263 --> 00:10:49.063
are truly born.

00:10:50.597 --> 00:10:51.997
Thank you.